# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:11
translate turkish adrian13_156a2700:

    # "My phone starts buzzing in my pocket. I pull it out and see that Adrian is calling."
    "Cebimdeki telefon titremeye başlıyor. Çıkarıp bakıyorum, arayan Adrian."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:15
translate turkish adrian13_bea5e8cb:

    # pc "Hello?"
    pc "Alo?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:16
translate turkish adrian13_f9cf1bde:

    # gg "Hey, [pcname]. You busy?"
    gg "Selam, [pcname]. Meşgul müsün?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:17
translate turkish adrian13_e74e5c12:

    # pc "Not really. What's up?"
    pc "Pek değil. Ne var ne yok?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:19
translate turkish adrian13_a2d441d4:

    # gg "There's this old arcade over on the east side of town that I haven't been to in years. I was wondering if you wanted to go check it out with me?"
    gg "Şehrin doğu tarafında, yıllardır gitmediğim eski bir oyun salonu var. Benimle birlikte gidip bir bakmak ister misin diye merak ediyordum?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:20
translate turkish adrian13_9ee91606:

    # pc "I didn't even know we had an arcade in town."
    pc "Şehirde bir oyun salonu olduğunu bile bilmiyordum."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:22
translate turkish adrian13_6580f309:

    # gg "Yeah, I think most people have forgotten about it. I don't know how they stay in business."
    gg "Evet, sanırım çoğu insan orayı unutmuş. Nasıl ayakta kaldıklarını bilmiyorum."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:23
translate turkish adrian13_7860a0fb:

    # gg "But I kind of wanted to go check it out, just to see what they're doing there, and maybe get some ideas for my arcade."
    gg "Ama ben de oraya bir göz atmak istedim, sadece orada ne yaptıklarını görmek ve belki benim oyun salonum için biraz fikir edinmek için."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:27
translate turkish adrian13_34b5448b:

    # gg "Poggers! Come and get me?"
    gg "Poggers! Gelip beni alacak mısın?"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:28
translate turkish adrian13_4724ea78:

    # pc "Sure, I'll be there in a few minutes."
    pc "Tabii, birkaç dakikaya orada olurum."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:29
translate turkish adrian13_5b5160ba:

    # gg "Okay, see you then!"
    gg "Tamam, o zaman görüşürüz!"

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:33
translate turkish adrian13_75da4880:

    # gg "Aw, alright."
    gg "Ah, peki."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:35
translate turkish adrian13_c01438a1:

    # gg "Well, if you want to go sometime, just give me a call."
    gg "Eh, bir ara gitmek istersen, beni ara yeter."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:36
translate turkish adrian13_ba01fe47:

    # pc "Okay, see you later, Adrian."
    pc "Tamam, sonra görüşürüz Adrian."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/adrian13.rpy:37
translate turkish adrian13_225cc39e:

    # gg "See ya."
    gg "Görüşürüz."

